All six commands pass --e2-extension and no --reseed-chemistry-from.
reseedChemistry defaults false and is never enabled by --e2-extension.
The same absolute output-prefix suffix is used by writer and validator.
Prior smoke/8M-to-24M transfers enabled reseedChemistry, so they executed this call.
